theorem coeff_classSum [DecidableEq (ConjClasses G)] (C : ConjClasses G) (y : G) :
    (classSum C).coeff y = if ConjClasses.mk y = C then 1 else 0 := by
  classical
  simp [classSum, coeff_sum, coeff_single, Finsupp.finset_sum_apply, Finsupp.single_apply]

/- English proof (translation)
Proceed by induction. Treat this case separately. Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. By extensionality, compare the relevant components. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules.

Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Supply the required witnesses or components. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Treat this case separately.

